---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Change one thing. Watch history rewrite itself.">
<h1 class="display-serif text-4xl">Change one thing. Watch history rewrite itself.</h1>
<p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl">A causal engine fans your what-if across politics, religion, science, culture, and economics — five generations deep. Branch any step. Compare timelines. Everything simulated is clearly labelled speculative fiction.</p>
<div class="mt-6 border-l-4 border-deepred pl-4">
<p class="display-serif">1440 · “The printing press was never invented.”</p>
<p class="text-sm opacity-70">├─ 1448 · Scribes keep power (Politics)</p>
<p class="text-sm opacity-70">└─ 1460 · Slow copying stalls ideas (Science) ── branch here?</p>
</div>
<a href="/start" class="mt-6 inline-block underline">Start a simulation</a>
</BaseLayout>
